1
00:00:00,823 --> 00:00:02,823
(Sheldon:)Tom is a paramedic
with the fire department.

2
00:00:02,992 --> 00:00:04,282
(Sheldon:)He's going to med school.

3
00:00:04,451 --> 00:00:09,251
(Sheldon:)Uh, he likes the outdoors
and, uh, strong women who initiate sex.

4
00:00:09,415 --> 00:00:12,335
(Leonard:)Really, really bad.

5
00:00:13,419 --> 00:00:17,759
(Sheldon:)I'm surprised you struck out with Penny.
Apparently, she's a big old five.

6
00:00:19,967 --> 00:00:22,597
- Sheldon, what do you want?
- Oh, good, you got my note.

7
00:00:22,761 --> 00:00:25,801
(Sheldon:)Penny, I'd like you to meet Tom.
Uh, Penny, this is Tom.

8
00:00:25,973 --> 00:00:28,433
(Sheldon:)- Tom, may I present Penny.
- Hi, Penny.

9
00:00:28,601 --> 00:00:32,851
Hi, as long as I'm here, I'm on a quest with
newbs, don't know what they're doing.

10
00:00:33,022 --> 00:00:35,272
Got one assassin, three spell casters,
no tank.

11
00:00:35,441 --> 00:00:37,271
- Can we talk later?
- No, I need you now.

12
00:00:37,443 --> 00:00:39,483
(Sheldon:)Wouldn't you prefer
to socialize with Tom...

13
00:00:39,653 --> 00:00:42,493
(Sheldon:)...who is a sexually passive
outdoorsman?

14
00:00:44,658 --> 00:00:48,288
- Whatever, I'll figure it out myself.
- Bye, Penny.

15
00:00:50,122 --> 00:00:53,462
(Tom:)I'm sorry, dude,
she didn't look anything like her picture.

16
00:00:55,127 --> 00:00:57,297
(Leonard:)They never do.

17
00:01:04,053 --> 00:01:05,553
HOWARD:
Hello, fair Penny.

18
00:01:05,721 --> 00:01:09,141
PENNY: Who are you?
HOWARD: It is I, Sir Howard of Wolowitz.

19
00:01:10,517 --> 00:01:13,437
(Warrior:)Can I interest you
in an afternoon of spirited questing...

20
00:01:13,604 --> 00:01:16,144
(Warrior:)...followed by a flagon of ale
at yon virtual tavern?

21
00:01:16,941 --> 00:01:18,321
PENNY:
Yeah, sure, why not?

22
00:01:21,862 --> 00:01:23,952
(Penny:)Oh, my God, I need help.

